metamusic ACE-Step worker image - third-party notices

This image runs ACE-Step 1.5 for music generation. Weights are NOT part of the image, except the ACE-Step base DiT
(see below); the main model bundle is mounted from RunPod's cached-model directory at run time.

ACE-Step 1.5 code
  Source:   https://github.com/ace-step/ACE-Step-1.5 (pinned commit: worker/contract/ACESTEP_COMMIT)
  Licence:  MIT, Copyright (c) 2026 ACEStep
  Included: the nano-vllm inference engine (acestep/third_parts/nano-vllm), MIT, Copyright (c) 2025 Xingkai Yu

ACE-Step model weights
  Models:   ACE-Step/Ace-Step1.5 (main bundle, at run time) and ACE-Step/acestep-v15-base (baked into this image
            at build time, sha256-verified against the Hugging Face listing at the pinned revision)
  Licence:  MIT per the model cards ("License: [MIT]"; front matter "license: mit")
  Cards state, verbatim: "Commercial-Ready: Unlike many models trained on ambiguous datasets, ACE-Step v1.5 is
            designed for creators. You can strictly use the generated music for commercial purposes."
            The training data is described as licensed music, royalty-free / public-domain music and synthetic
            MIDI-to-audio data.
  The cards carry no warranty, indemnity or usage-restriction text; wording in public documents is "code MIT;
  weights MIT per model card". The card text is kept next to the baked base weights (README.md).

Qwen3 (Alibaba Cloud) - Apache License 2.0
  The ACE-Step main bundle redistributes models derived from Qwen3:
    acestep-5Hz-lm-1.7B       the 5 Hz language model, based on Qwen/Qwen3-1.7B
    Qwen3-Embedding-0.6B      the text encoder (a copy of Qwen/Qwen3-Embedding-0.6B)
  Upstream licence, read at the revisions below:
    Qwen/Qwen3-1.7B @ 70d244cc86ccca08cf5af4e1e306ecf908b1ad5e
        LICENSE: Apache License, Version 2.0, "Copyright 2024 Alibaba Cloud"
        ("Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (the "License"); you may not use this file except in
        compliance with the License. ... distributed under the License is distributed on an "AS IS" BASIS, WITHOUT
        WARRANTIES OR CONDITIONS OF ANY KIND, either express or implied.")
    Qwen/Qwen3-Embedding-0.6B @ 97b0c614be4d77ee51c0cef4e5f07c00f9eb65b3
        model card front matter: "license: apache-2.0" (the repository has no separate LICENSE file)
  Apache-2.0 section 4 obligations: a copy of the licence accompanies this notice (the text below); the models are
  modified (the LM is fine-tuned by ACE-Step; this worker changes no weights); the NOTICE of the upstream models
  contains no attribution text beyond the copyright line above.

Python packages
  PyTorch, torchaudio, torchvision, transformers, diffusers and the other packages listed at the end of this file
  are installed under their own licences, listed per distribution below. The flash-attn wheel is a third-party
  prebuild (mjun0812/flash-attention-prebuild-wheels v0.7.12) of Dao-AILab/flash-attention (BSD-3-Clause); it is
  pinned by sha256 in worker/Dockerfile.acestep.

System packages (Debian): libsndfile1 (LGPL-2.1+), ffmpeg (LGPL-2.1+/GPL-2+ build as packaged by Debian); both are
  dynamically used through their own interfaces and are unmodified.
